      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1212633223,
      "text": "Urtica membranacea is a species of annual herb in the family Urticaceae native to the Mediterranean Basin. They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 39 cm tall."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Urtica membranacea",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urtica_membranacea",
